        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;11&lt;/b&gt; · from now on &lt;b&gt;every card is ignored except the END card&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;The robot drives straight past every station without stopping or talking." role="wire-label" status="" placeholders="1" id="m11">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;fillOpacity=95;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#475569;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shadow=0;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="911" y="850" width="520" height="56" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="anchor" status="" placeholders="1" id="m12_a">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1171" y="968" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="anchor" status="" placeholders="1" id="m12_b">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1431" y="968" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;12&lt;/b&gt; · END card reached at last: &lt;b&gt;STOP&lt;/b&gt;, and stay stopped there" role="wire-label" status="" placeholders="1" id="m12_t">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fillOpacity=95;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shadow=0;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1185" y="914" width="232" height="42" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="anchor" status="" placeholders="1" id="m13_a">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="386" y="1072" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="anchor" status="" placeholders="1" id="m13_b">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="651" y="1072" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;13&lt;/b&gt; · held for 3 seconds, or switched off on the staff page" role="wire-label" status="" placeholders="1" id="m13_t">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fillOpacity=95;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shadow=0;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="400" y="1030" width="237" height="30" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="anchor" status="" placeholders="1" id="m14_a">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="651" y="1126" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="anchor" status="" placeholders="1" id="m14_b">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="911" y="1126" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;14&lt;/b&gt; · siren off, blinking stops" role="wire-label" status="" placeholders="1" id="m14_t">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fillOpacity=95;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shadow=0;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="665" y="1084" width="232" height="30" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="anchor" status="" placeholders="1" id="m15_a">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="651" y="1182" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="anchor" status="" placeholders="1" id="m15_b">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1171" y="1182" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;15&lt;/b&gt; · shouts “all clear” 6 times, then every 2 s" role="wire-label" status="" placeholders="1" id="m15_t">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fillOpacity=95;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shadow=0;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="665" y="1136" width="492" height="34" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="anchor" status="" placeholders="1" id="m16_a">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1171" y="1236" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="anchor" status="" placeholders="1" id="m16_b">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=rect;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1431" y="1236" width="1" height="1" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;16&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;b&gt;STOP&lt;/b&gt; — and stay stopped" role="wire-label" status="" placeholders="1" id="m16_t">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fillOpacity=95;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F2937;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;shadow=0;connectable=0;pointerEvents=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1185" y="1194" width="232" height="30" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;17 · The robot does not simply carry on.&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp; After an all-clear it stays parked with the brakes on. Somebody has to walk over and tap the &lt;b&gt;START card&lt;/b&gt; — the same card that begins every normal tour. This is on purpose: after an evacuation the robot is somewhere it was never meant to be, and a person needs to put it back before the tour restarts." role="note" status="" placeholders="1" id="final">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=note;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#C62828;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=11;fontColor=#7F1D1D;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=9;shadow=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="290" y="1262" width="1500" height="62" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;WHAT THE ARROWS MEAN&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#C62828&quot;&gt;━━━▶ &lt;b&gt;The alarm shout&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748B&quot;&gt;  radio, to every board at once, no reply&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#7C3AED&quot;&gt;━━━▶ &lt;b&gt;Words down a wire&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748B&quot;&gt;  between the robot and its own boards&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4F46E5&quot;&gt;━━━▶ &lt;b&gt;A plain pin&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748B&quot;&gt;  button in, siren and lights out&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#94A3B8&quot;&gt;▭ &lt;b&gt;Grey box&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#64748B&quot;&gt;  a board doing something by itself&lt;/font&gt;" role="legend" status="" placeholders="1" id="legend">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="52" y="1352" width="400" height="226" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;WHY SHOUT IT SIX TIMES?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The radio gives no receipt. The hub sends the message and never finds out whether anyone heard it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If a single shout went missing, the robot could sit happily talking at a station while the siren is already going and people are leaving.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Six copies, 60 ms apart, take about a third of a second of air time and make that almost impossible.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;After the burst, repeating every 2 seconds is enough. A robot that reboots, or was switched on late, catches up within 2 seconds without the hub having to keep a list of who is listening." role="legend" status="" placeholders="1" id="why6">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="476" y="1352" width="400" height="226" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;WHAT THE ALARM SWITCHES OFF&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;The whole card table.&lt;/b&gt; Normally each station card parks the robot and starts a talk. While the alarm is up, none of that happens.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;The START card too.&lt;/b&gt; It is ignored — there is nothing to restart into.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Only the END card still works&lt;/b&gt;, and it does exactly what it always does: stop the robot and keep it stopped.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Playing a track by hand&lt;/b&gt; from the USB console is refused as well, because that would park the robot halfway down the rail.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Any queued photo&lt;/b&gt; is dropped the moment the alarm arrives." role="legend" status="" placeholders="1" id="overrule">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="900" y="1352" width="440" height="226" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="&lt;b&gt;WORTH KNOWING&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;The robot never answers.&lt;/b&gt; It only ever listens. The hub has no idea whether the robot is even switched on.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Both ways in are equal.&lt;/b&gt; The physical button and the staff page switch write to the same place, and clearing from one clears the other — including silencing the siren.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bench testing.&lt;/b&gt; You can fake an alarm from the robot's USB console with the letter &lt;b&gt;e&lt;/b&gt;. A real hub will overrule your fake one within 2 seconds, on its next repeat." role="legend" status="" placeholders="1" id="source">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1.2;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=10;fontColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;shadow=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="1364" y="1352" width="424" height="226" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="" role="link" placeholders="1" id="m1">
